    "id": "AC02",
    "title": "树、coverage与索引",
    "statement": "BodyDef按前序遍历建立AllParts/原版Index；父指针按结构建立。root withChildren=1，child=parent*relativeCoverage；self=withChildren*max(0,1−直接子coverage和)，残差abs<1e−5归0。未指定height/depth由父继承，根默认Middle/Outside。groups不从父自动继承。",
