  {
    "id": "AC04",
    "title": "缺失子树与旧伤清理",
    "statement": "非核心部位GetPartHealth==0后创建MissingPart，天然部位IsFresh=true。MissingPart.PostAdd调用RestorePart保留自身例外，递归清除该部位与后代未标keepOnBodyPartRestoration的旧hediff，再给每个子节点递归建立nonfresh缺失。原版逐节点存MissingPart；项目只存最高根并推导后代属于存储适配，必须同样清除普通伤口，不能双计旧痛/旧出血。",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "sources": [
      {
        "group": "combat",
        "type": "Verse.HediffSet",
        "line_start": 310,
        "line_end": 370,
        "range_sha256": "d6ef1c3269dcba097d8ffa90ee746d795c0f92fe681b74253dda86f66507a683"
      },
