      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "AC05",
    "title": "新鲜残端",
    "statement": "IsFresh要求存储fresh且age<90000源tick；fresh、Outside、非solid、无缺失parent且无义体祖先时，残端bleed=maxHP*.12*partBleed*raceBleed，pain=maxHP*.0125/HealthScale。Inside、solid、非fresh不贡献这条残端；成功Tended令IsFresh=false，质量0也可以；ShouldRemove=false，护理不恢复部位。直接Dev AddMissing默认fresh=false。",
