  {
    "id": "AC07",
    "title": "部位效率",
    "statement": "CalculatePartEfficiency先遇到祖先AddedPart即返回其partEfficiency；父缺失返回0。自身addedPart倍率连乘；同部位Stage效率offset相加，ignoreMissingHP取任一true。未忽略HP时乘整数PartHealth/maxHP；Outside非core把该比例作InverseLerp(.1,1,r)。最后加offset并夹>=0。天然身体无义体/Stage时即该HP效率；不能把所有内部器官也套外部10%区间。",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "sources": [
