  {
    "id": "AC11",
    "title": "呼吸循环过滤",
    "statement": "BloodPumping=tag(BloodPumpingSource)；Breathing=tag(BreathingSource)*min(tag(BreathingPathway),1)*min(tag(BreathingSourceCage),1)；有Kidney tag时BloodFiltration=tag(Kidney)*tag(Liver)，否则tag(BloodFiltrationSource)。Human肺平均、胸廓为ribcage/sternum平均、颈为pathway、双肾平均再乘肝。",
