  {
    "id": "AC12",
    "title": "意识",
    "statement": "Consciousness从Brain的ConsciousnessSource效率开始；painPenalty=clamp((pain−.1)/.9*.4,0,.4)，只有>=.01才扣。随后乘(.8+.2min(BloodPumping,1))*(.8+.2min(Breathing,1))*(.9+.1min(BloodFiltration,1))；健康阶段offset等最后在能力wrapper应用。",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "sources": [
      {
        "group": "survival",
        "type": "RimWorld.PawnCapacityWorker_Consciousness",
        "line_start": 1,
