      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "AC13",
    "title": "操作与移动",
    "statement": "Manipulation=limbEfficiency(.8)*Consciousness。Moving在alwaysDowned生命阶段为0；limbEfficiency(.4)若functional<.4999则0，否则再乘Pelvis、Spine、(.8+.2Breathing)、(.8+.2BloodPumping)、min(Consciousness,1)。呼吸/泵血在Moving这里不设1上限。",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "sources": [
