    "title": "说话进食消化",
    "statement": "Talking=source*min(pathway,1)*min(tongue,1)*Consciousness；Eating=eatingSource*min(pathway,1)*(.5+.5*tongue)*Consciousness；Metabolism是MetabolismSource平均，Human胃和肝。Talking/Eating昏迷早退0；Eating普通最终floor.1；Metabolism是血肉必需致死能力。",
