  {
    "id": "AC19",
    "title": "外部保留与过量伤",
    "statement": "外部非core且D>=当前HP时计算f=(D−HP)/maxHP，以overkill区间InverseLerp抽签；失败削为HP−1，成功保留D。Cut/Bite区间0~.1，Stab/Blunt/Poke .4~1。调用位置由worker决定：Blunt override不调用通用外部保1，不能给所有Blunt统一套保护。Bite仅强制Outside并继承base的保留、写伤及Inside时外层复制，没有Cut邻近裂伤。",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "sources": [
      {
        "group": "combat",
        "type": "Verse.DamageWorker_AddInjury",
